        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sebastian Gutierrez, Mathieu Kassovitz\n- Films: Gothika, Snakes on a Plane, The Eye, The Big Bounce, Women in Trouble, Elektra Luxx, Judas Kiss\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, film producer\n\nFacts:\n- Sebastian Gutierrez was born on September 10, 1974, and he is a Venezuelan film director, screenwriter, and film producer.\n- Sebastian Gutierrez directed the 1998 film Judas Kiss.\n- Gothika is a 2003 American psychological horror thriller film directed by Mathieu Kassovitz and written by Sebastian Gutierrez.\n- Sebastian Gutierrez is known for writing the screenplays for Snakes on a Plane, The Eye, The Big Bounce, and Gothika.\n- Sebastian Gutierrez wrote and directed the independent female-driven ensemble comedies Women in Trouble and Elektra Luxx.",
